    The Libertinus\ font family is highly versatile and very well suited
    as an alternative to Computer Modern when typesetting a document
    with \TeX. One of its family members is Libertinus Keyboard Regular,
    a font that produces glyphs representing {keyboard} keys.
    The font uses \relax{ligatures} to produce special keys like
    {Esc}, all of which have been compiled into an overview in
    this article.
